87  async releaseTransientResources(): Promise<void> {
88    this.semanticQueries.releaseTransientResources();
89  }
Before: the exported service starts project release and returns void.

BASE · a1e325a5 · packages/backend-typescript/src/typescript-backend/typescript-semantic-query-service.ts:125–128

125  releaseTransientResources(): void {
126    this.clearQueryCaches();
127    this.projects?.releaseTransientResources();
128  }
After: the backend awaits the service.

HEAD · 64919bcb · packages/backend-typescript/src/typescript-backend/typescript-backend.ts:87–89

87  async releaseTransientResources(): Promise<void> {
88    await this.semanticQueries.releaseTransientResources();
89  }
After: the service awaits the project graph.

HEAD · 64919bcb · packages/backend-typescript/src/typescript-backend/typescript-semantic-query-service.ts:129–132

129  async releaseTransientResources(): Promise<void> {
130    this.cacheScope.releaseTransientResources();
131    await this.projects?.releaseTransientResources();
132  }
Pending completion and propagated rejection are explicit new expectations.

