PR BODY · bundle · inputs/pr-127/pr.json → body:3–3

3The [daemon architecture spec](https://github.com/mohasarc/symnav/blob/main/plans/005/daemon-architecture-functional-spec.md) assigns turn-scoped semantic-cache lifetime to core. Building on #126, this layer moves only cache lifetime out of TypeScript while preserving all six algorithms, key spaces, promise/value identities, and failure behavior.
